  "notes": "Calendar includes styles for different calendar libraries.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/calendar/+page.md",
  "code": "<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vanilla-calendar-pro/index.js\" defer></script>\n\n<div id=\"calendar\" class=\"vc\"></div>\n\n<script>\n  document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n    const { Calendar } = window.VanillaCalendarPro\n    const calendar = new Calendar(\"#calendar\")\n    calendar.init()\n  })\n</script>",
